    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Pauline, infirmi\u00e8re \u00e0 domicile, entre Lens et Lille, s\u2019occupe seule de ses deux enfants et de son p\u00e8re ancien m\u00e9tallurgiste. D\u00e9vou\u00e9e et g\u00e9n\u00e9reuse, tous ses patients l'aiment et comptent sur elle. Profitant de sa popularit\u00e9, les dirigeants d\u2019un parti extr\u00e9miste vont lui proposer d\u2019\u00eatre leur candidate aux prochaines municipales.",
        "english": "Pauline, a home help nurse, working between Lens and Lille, raises her two children alone, while also looking after her father, a former steelworker. Devoted and generous, all her patients love and depend on her. Taking advantage of her popularity, the directors of an extremist political party suggest she become their candidat at the mayoral elections."
